# Claude Code files that belong to one person or one computer, never to the
# repository. The guide, .claude/CLAUDE.md, is not one of them: it is tracked,
# and so is anything else under .claude/ that is not named here.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/*.local.*
CLAUDE.local.md
# Claude Code does not read this one. The companion claude-md-management
# writes a person's own notes to it, and expects git to ignore it.
.claude.local.md
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/agent-memory-local/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.*
